## Introduction

This is an introduction to the analysis of youth migration from Estonia, specifically focusing on the period of 2015-2024 in the context of Harju maakond and age groups of 7-16 and 17-26. The dataset is small and very focused, with emphasis on trying to see the probability of youths from different age groups migrating from Harjumaa.

The dataset was taken from the Statistics Estonia website: https://andmed.stat.ee/et/stat/eri-valdkondade-statistika__noorteseire/NH03, where only a small part of the actual data input was used to observe a specific problem.

The problem is relatively simple and will be focusing on conditional probability, where probability "P" is dependent on "A" and "B" age group and therefore the notation is following P(A|B).

